  1330  /*!
  1331   * Copy the bytes from the tile buffer into the mask tile QImage.
  1332   * \param layer layer containing the tile buffer and the mask tile matrix.
  1333   * \param i column index of current tile.
  1334   * \param j row index of current tile.
